          "type": "content_block",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The Importance of Regular Jewellery Cleaning",
            "body": "<p>Regular cleaning is the cornerstone of jewellery care. Even with careful wear, jewellery can accumulate dirt, oils, and grime from daily use. This buildup can dull the appearance of metals and gemstones, and in some cases, even lead to long-term damage.</p>",
            "callout": false,
            "list_heading": "Benefits of regular cleaning:",
            "list_items": "Maintaining the brilliance and shine of your jewellery\nPreventing the buildup of harmful substances\nEarly detection of loose stones or damaged settings\nProlonging the life of your jewellery",
            "list_style": "bullet",
            "image_1_alt": "Gold hoop pearl drop earrings on satin ready for gentle cleaning",
            "image_1_fallback": "gold-hoop-pearl-drop-earrings.webp",
